  "cards": [
    {
      "dot": "emerald",
      "title": "Game seams",
      "items": [
        "GameRegistry (core:game) is the only GameId → GamePlugin lookup; AppModule builds it from getAll<GamePlugin>() sorted by GAME_ORDER = zip, tango, queens (unlisted ids last, then by id).",
        "GamePlayRegistry (core:game-ui) is built once in AppModule from getAll<GamePlayUi>(); a duplicate game id throws.",
        "Each game module binds its DailySource (bind DailySource::class); core:data's DailyRepository collects them by gameId, and they fetch through core:network's FeedTransport.",
        "Features never name a game: play:impl drives every game through GamePlayUi; Home and History resolve games through GameRegistry."
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "rose",
      "title": "Forbidden edges · ./gradlew checkModuleGraph",
      "items": [
        "anything → :app; :core:testing from a non-test configuration",
        "core:* → non-core; feature:* → games:*",
        "feature:*:api → anything but core:navigation / core:model",
        "feature:a:impl → feature:b:impl (depend on the other feature's :api)",
        "games:* → feature:*; games:x → games:y, except games:x-ui → games:x",
        "Every configuration is checked, test ones included; check, preBuild and classes depend on it via the application, android.library and jvm.library convention plugins. Rationale: docs/adr/0008-module-graph.md"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "amber",
      "title": "Adding a game",
      "items": [
        "settings.gradle.kts: include :games:<id> and :games:<id>-ui",
        "games/<id> (jvm.library, api core:game): rules, codec, DailySource, GamePlugin, Koin module with the plugin qualified by id + bind DailySource::class",
        "games/<id>-ui (on games:<id>, core:game, core:game-ui, core:designsystem): GamePlayController, GamePlayUi, <id>UiModule",
        "app: implementation of both modules, both Koin modules in appModules, the id in GAME_ORDER — no core:* or feature:* change"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "slate",
      "title": "Edges summarized",
      "items": [
        ":app depends on every module; only its entry edges are drawn.",
        "puzzlebox.android.feature.api adds api(core:navigation); puzzlebox.android.feature.impl adds core:designsystem to every impl.",
        "home:impl → home/play/history/profile api, core:navigation, data, game, domain, model · play:impl → play/home api, core:navigation, common, data, game, game-ui · history:impl → history/play api, core:navigation, data, game, domain · profile:impl → profile api, core:data, domain",
        "core:model / core:common are shared leaves (data, datastore, domain, game, game-ui also depend on them); core:network → core:game only.",
        "core:testing (api core:data) is test-only: app, core:data, core:domain, every feature impl and games:zip-ui use it."
      ]
    }
  ]
